    nutrition: { focus: 'Financial Habit: Live on last year\'s income for one month', meal_theme: 'Resisting lifestyle inflation', plan: 'Research what you were earning 2-3 years ago. For this month, try to live on that amount — even if you now earn more. The difference between your current income and your "last year\'s income" goes entirely to savings, debt payoff, or investment.', tip: 'Lifestyle inflation is automatic. Lifestyle discipline is intentional. The gap between income and spending is where wealth is built.', recipe_search: 'simple satisfying frugal' },
